<h2>Compare the process, not just the possible price</h2>
<p>A traditional listing can be a good fit for some sellers. But if you already have a CashAsIs offer, compare what each option actually asks you to do before you get paid.</p>
<p>How much preparation is required? How many steps are between you and closing? Could the asking price need to change? What expenses continue while you wait? And how much uncertainty are you comfortable with?</p>

